Description: A clip's corrected 3D input shows in the clip monitor at once
 When the person corrects the 3D input of a clip (its packing, Swap left and
 right eyes) in its properties, the project monitor shows the correction at
 once, but the clip monitor read a clip's 3D input only when it displayed a
 frame, so a still kept the eyes it showed until the clip was opened again
 (a still displays no other frame). The clip is now told to the clip monitor
 when it shows that clip: the monitor reads the input again and draws the
 frame again.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-yet
Last-Update: 2026-11-22
